title: "What Tempering Can and Cannot Guarantee for Fractional-Order State-of-Charge Observers: Rate Ceiling, Certified Finite Memory and a Negative Offline Test on CALCE Data"
abstract: "Reproducibility package (code, configuration, saved results, figures, tables, reports and technical reports) for a study of tempered fractional-order state-of-charge observers for lithium-ion cells, tested offline on the CALCE INR18650-20R dataset."
